    "description": "A small, slow-growing, upright tree, ultimately reaching 3m in height and spread. The fan-like foliage has 11 short lobes, opens pale orange in spring, turns lime green for summer and orange-red in autumn. Tiny, purple-red flowers in spring are followed by conspicuous, red, winged fruit held above the foliage in late summer",
